      "filePath": "FoxChat-vue/src/utils/request.js",
      "summary": "Axios HTTP 客户端封装，提供请求/响应拦截器：自动管理全局 Loading 状态、标准化业务错误处理、401 自动跳转登录页，支持 Cookie 鉴权。",
      "tags": ["http-client", "middleware", "error-handling", "utility"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:FoxChat-vue/src/views/Home.vue",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "Home.vue",
      "filePath": "FoxChat-vue/src/views/Home.vue",
      "summary": "核心聊天主界面组件，集成私聊/群聊消息收发、WebSocket 实时通信、好友与群组管理、RAG 知识检索、LLM AI 对话、情绪显示、消息撤回/删除等功能，是整个前端应用的核心业务中枢。",
      "tags": ["chat-interface", "websocket", "component", "core-view", "ai-integration"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Vue 3 Composition API 大型单文件组件(2922行)，包含 30+ 业务函数，通过 WebSocket 实现二进制协议编解码通信，集成 LLM 流式对话和 RAG 检索增强。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:FoxChat-vue/src/views/Login.vue",
